Ladybird paints SVG mask glyphs and exposes their geometry at the
original DOM code-unit indices. With a combining sequence or a
supplementary character followed by x, Firefox 151.0 and WebKit 26.5
exposed all three UTF-16 code units. Chrome 158.0.8127.36 exposed two,
the number of rendered marks.

Gecko counts addressable characters in SVGTextFrame::GetNumberOfChars().
WebKit counts fragment lengths in
SVGTextQuery::numberOfCharactersCallback(). Blink counts inline text in
SvgTextQuery::NumberOfCharacters(). SVG 2 assigns DOM indices before
text transformation.
